{"parse":{"title":"2022 Cannes Film Festival","pageid":70064049,"revid":1375928252,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Short_Films_Competition\">Short Films Competition</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_Cannes_Film_Festival&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Short Films Competition\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_Cannes_Film_Festival&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Short Films Competition\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Out of 3,507 entries, the following films were selected to compete for the <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Film_Palme_d%27Or\" title=\"Short Film Palme d&#39;Or\">Short Film Palme d'Or</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">English Title\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Original Title\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Director(s)\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Production Country\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>A Short Story</i></td>\n<td><span title=\"Chinese-language text\"><span lang=\"zh\">\u7834\u788e\u592a\u9633\u4e4b\u5fc3</span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bi_Gan_(film_director)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bi Gan (film director)\">Bi Gan</a></td>\n<td>China\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Cherries_(film)\" title=\"Cherries (film)\">Cherries</a></i></td>\n<td><span title=\"Lithuanian-language text\"><i lang=\"lt\">Uogos</i></span></td>\n<td>Vytautas Katkus</td>\n<td>Lithuania\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>Fire at the Lake</i></td>\n<td><span title=\"French-language text\"><i lang=\"fr\">Le Feu au lac</i></span></td>\n<td>Pierre Menahem</td>\n<td>France\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>Melancholy of my Mother's Lullabies</i></td>\n<td><i>Lori</i></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Abinash_Bikram_Shah\" title=\"Abinash Bikram Shah\">Abinash Bikram Shah</a></td>\n<td>Nepal, Hong Kong\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>Night Light</i></td>\n<td><span title=\"Spanish-language text\"><i lang=\"es\">Luz Nocturna</i></span></td>\n<td>Kim Torres</td>\n<td>Costa Rica\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>Persona</i></td>\n<td><span title=\"Korean-language text\"><span lang=\"ko\">\uac01\uc9c8</span></span></td>\n<td>Moon Sujin</td>\n<td>South Korea\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Same_Old\" title=\"Same Old\">Same Old</a></i></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lloyd_Lee_Choi\" title=\"Lloyd Lee Choi\">Lloyd Lee Choi</a></td>\n<td>United States, Canada\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><i>Tsutsu\u025b</i></td>\n<td>Amartei Armar</td>\n<td>Ghana, France\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#FFDEAD;\">\n<td><i><b>The Water Murmurs</b></i></td>\n<td><span title=\"Chinese-language text\"><span lang=\"zh\">\u6d77\u8fb9\u5347\u8d77\u4e00\u5ea7\u60ac\u5d16</span></span></td>\n<td><b>Chen Jianying</b></td>\n<td><b>China</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw\u2010api\u2010ext.codfw.main\u20107448d946f4\u20102psms\nCached time: 20261030030637\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.144 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.172 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 44/1000000\nRevision size: 1182/2097152 bytes\nPost\u2010expand include size: 1564/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.122/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 15501586/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  162